IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `eia-core`

-- Employment Insurance Act (S.C. 1996, c. 23), Schedule VI (Subparagraph 12(2.3)(a)(ii)): Regions for the Purpose of
-- Benefits for Seasonal Workers. Written by piece ei6 (Sonnet 5.5) on 2026-10-24.
-- Text: the unofficial plain-text rendering of the Justice Laws consolidation current to 2026-09-30; nothing here is
-- claimed to be verified against the official text.
--
-- Seat: a person asking whether the place where they ordinarily live is in one of the regions of Schedule VI, which
-- s 12(2.3) (piece ei1) makes one condition of the seasonal workers' table (Schedule V).
--
-- A PLACE is described by the facts a person can look up in Statistics Canada's classification: the province or territory,
-- the number of its census division, the number of its census subdivision, and the census metropolitan area or census
-- agglomeration it is part of, if any. The Schedule's "Census Agglomeration" and "Census Subdivision" mean the classification
-- of 1996 for sections 4 and 6 and that of 2011 for sections 5 and 7 (s 1): the numbers must be given in that classification,
-- and `Schedule VI s 1 the classification that gives the meaning of the term in the section` says which.
-- The census subdivision numbers are whole numbers: "01557" of section 6 is 1557.
-- The regions do not overlap in the text; the rule that names a place's region tries them in the order of the Schedule.

§ `Schedule VI, section 1 - interpretation`

-- src:3546 | Census Agglomeration for the purposes of section 4 means a census agglomeration within the meaning of the Statistics Canada document entitled Standard Geographical Classification (SGC) 1996 and for the purposes of sections 5 and 7 means a census agglomeration within the meaning of the Statistics Canada document entitled Standard Geographical Classification (SGC) 2011. (agglomération de recensement)
-- src:3547 | Census Division means a census division within the meaning of the Statistics Canada document entitled Standard Geographical Classification (SGC) 1996. (division de recensement)
-- src:3548 | Census Metropolitan Area means a census metropolitan area within the meaning of the Statistics Canada document entitled Standard Geographical Classification (SGC) 1996. (région métropolitaine de recensement)
-- src:3549 | Census Subdivision for the purposes of sections 4 and 6 means a census subdivision within the meaning of the Statistics Canada document entitled Standard Geographical Classification (SGC) 1996 and for the purposes of sections 5 and 7 means a census subdivision within the meaning of the Statistics Canada document entitled Standard Geographical Classification (SGC) 2011. (subdivision de recensement)
@ref Employment Insurance Act Schedule VI s 1 (src:3546-3549)
DECLARE `ei6 Term defined in section 1 of Schedule VI` IS ONE OF
    `ei6 Census Agglomeration`
    `ei6 Census Division`
    `ei6 Census Metropolitan Area`
    `ei6 Census Subdivision`

-- src:3546 | Census Agglomeration for the purposes of section 4 means a census agglomeration within the meaning of the Statistics Canada document entitled Standard Geographical Classification (SGC) 1996 and for the purposes of sections 5 and 7 means a census agglomeration within the meaning of the Statistics Canada document entitled Standard Geographical Classification (SGC) 2011. (agglomération de recensement)
-- src:3547 | Census Division means a census division within the meaning of the Statistics Canada document entitled Standard Geographical Classification (SGC) 1996. (division de recensement)
-- src:3548 | Census Metropolitan Area means a census metropolitan area within the meaning of the Statistics Canada document entitled Standard Geographical Classification (SGC) 1996. (région métropolitaine de recensement)
-- src:3549 | Census Subdivision for the purposes of sections 4 and 6 means a census subdivision within the meaning of the Statistics Canada document entitled Standard Geographical Classification (SGC) 1996 and for the purposes of sections 5 and 7 means a census subdivision within the meaning of the Statistics Canada document entitled Standard Geographical Classification (SGC) 2011. (subdivision de recensement)
@ref Employment Insurance Act Schedule VI s 1 (src:3546-3549)
DECLARE `ei6 Standard Geographical Classification` IS ONE OF
    `ei6 SGC 1996`
    `ei6 SGC 2011`

-- The section of Schedule VI (4, 5, 6 or 7) in which the term is used: Census Agglomeration is used in sections 4, 5 and 7;
-- a term used in no section where it is defined for has no classification: NOTHING.
-- src:3546 | Census Agglomeration for the purposes of section 4 means a census agglomeration within the meaning of the Statistics Canada document entitled Standard Geographical Classification (SGC) 1996 and for the purposes of sections 5 and 7 means a census agglomeration within the meaning of the Statistics Canada document entitled Standard Geographical Classification (SGC) 2011. (agglomération de recensement)
-- src:3547 | Census Division means a census division within the meaning of the Statistics Canada document entitled Standard Geographical Classification (SGC) 1996. (division de recensement)
-- src:3548 | Census Metropolitan Area means a census metropolitan area within the meaning of the Statistics Canada document entitled Standard Geographical Classification (SGC) 1996. (région métropolitaine de recensement)
-- src:3549 | Census Subdivision for the purposes of sections 4 and 6 means a census subdivision within the meaning of the Statistics Canada document entitled Standard Geographical Classification (SGC) 1996 and for the purposes of sections 5 and 7 means a census subdivision within the meaning of the Statistics Canada document entitled Standard Geographical Classification (SGC) 2011. (subdivision de recensement)
@ref Employment Insurance Act Schedule VI s 1 (src:3546-3549)
GIVEN term IS A `ei6 Term defined in section 1 of Schedule VI`
      section IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE `ei6 Standard Geographical Classification`
DECIDE `Schedule VI s 1 the classification that gives the meaning of the term in the section` IS
    CONSIDER term
    WHEN `ei6 Census Agglomeration` THEN
        BRANCH IF section EQUALS 4 THEN JUST `ei6 SGC 1996`
               IF section EQUALS 5 THEN JUST `ei6 SGC 2011`
               IF section EQUALS 7 THEN JUST `ei6 SGC 2011`
               OTHERWISE NOTHING
    WHEN `ei6 Census Division` THEN JUST `ei6 SGC 1996`
    WHEN `ei6 Census Metropolitan Area` THEN JUST `ei6 SGC 1996`
    WHEN `ei6 Census Subdivision` THEN
        BRANCH IF section EQUALS 4 THEN JUST `ei6 SGC 1996`
               IF section EQUALS 6 THEN JUST `ei6 SGC 1996`
               IF section EQUALS 5 THEN JUST `ei6 SGC 2011`
               IF section EQUALS 7 THEN JUST `ei6 SGC 2011`
               OTHERWISE NOTHING

§ `The place and the regions`

DECLARE `ei6 Province or territory of Schedule VI` IS ONE OF
    `ei6 Quebec`
    `ei6 Nova Scotia`
    `ei6 New Brunswick`
    `ei6 Prince Edward Island`
    `ei6 Newfoundland/Labrador`
    `ei6 Yukon`
    `ei6 another province or territory`

DECLARE `ei6 Area of Schedule VI` IS ONE OF
    `ei6 the Census Metropolitan Area of Quebec City`
    `ei6 the Census Metropolitan Area of Trois-Rivières`
    `ei6 the Census Metropolitan Area of Sherbrooke`
    `ei6 the Census Metropolitan Area of Montréal`
    `ei6 the Census Metropolitan Area of Ottawa — Hull`
    `ei6 the Census Metropolitan Area of Chicoutimi — Jonquière`
    `ei6 the Census Metropolitan Area of Halifax`
    `ei6 the Census Metropolitan Area of Saint John`
    `ei6 the Census Metropolitan Area of St. John’s`
    `ei6 the Census Agglomeration of Moncton`
    `ei6 the Census Agglomeration of Charlottetown`
    `ei6 the Census Agglomeration of Whitehorse`
    `ei6 no census metropolitan area or census agglomeration named in Schedule VI`

DECLARE `ei6 Place for Schedule VI` HAS
    `ei6 province or territory of the place`          IS A `ei6 Province or territory of Schedule VI`
    `ei6 census division number of the place`         IS A NUMBER
    `ei6 census subdivision number of the place`      IS A NUMBER
    `ei6 area that the place is part of`              IS A `ei6 Area of Schedule VI`

DECLARE `ei6 Region of Schedule VI` IS ONE OF
    `ei6 the region of Gaspésie — Îles-de-la-Madeleine`
    `ei6 the region of Central Quebec`
    `ei6 the region of North Western Quebec`
    `ei6 the region of Lower Saint Lawrence and North Shore`
    `ei6 the region of Chicoutimi — Jonquière`
    `ei6 the region of Eastern Nova Scotia`
    `ei6 the region of Western Nova Scotia`
    `ei6 the region of Madawaska — Charlotte`
    `ei6 the region of Restigouche — Albert`
    `ei6 the region of Charlottetown`
    `ei6 the region of Prince Edward Island`
    `ei6 the region of Newfoundland/Labrador`
    `ei6 the region of Yukon`
    `ei6 no region of Schedule VI`

-- A whole number from lo to hi, both ends included ("Census Division Nos. 1 to 8").
GIVEN n IS A NUMBER
      lo IS A NUMBER
      hi IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`ei6 the number lies from` n `to` lo `and` hi MEANS n AT LEAST lo AND n AT MOST hi

§ `Schedule VI, section 2 - Quebec`

-- src:3554 | 2 (1) The region of Gaspésie — Îles-de-la-Madeleine, consisting of Census Division Nos. 1 to 8 and 98.
@ref Employment Insurance Act Schedule VI s 2(1) (src:3554)
GIVEN place IS A `ei6 Place for Schedule VI`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Schedule VI s 2(1) the place is in the region of Gaspésie — Îles-de-la-Madeleine` IF
        place's `ei6 province or territory of the place` EQUALS `ei6 Quebec`
    AND (   `ei6 the number lies from` cd `to` 1 `and` 8
         OR cd EQUALS 98)
    WHERE
        cd MEANS place's `ei6 census division number of the place`

-- src:3555 | (2) The region of Central Quebec, consisting of
-- src:3556 | (a) those portions of Census Division Nos. 21 and 22 that are not part of the Census Metropolitan Area of Quebec City;
-- src:3557 | (b) those portions of Census Division Nos. 37 and 38 that are not part of the Census Metropolitan Area of Trois-Rivières;
-- src:3558 | (c) those portions of Census Division Nos. 41, 42, 44 and 45 that are not part of the Census Metropolitan Area of Sherbrooke;
-- src:3559 | (d) those portions of Census Division Nos. 52, 60, 75 and 76 that are not part of the Census Metropolitan Area of Montréal;
-- src:3560 | (e) the portion of Census Division No. 82 that is not part of the Census Metropolitan Area of Ottawa — Hull; and
-- src:3561 | (f) Census Division Nos. 31 to 36, 39, 40, 48, 49, 50, 51, 53, 61, 62, 63, 77, 78, 80 and 90.
@ref Employment Insurance Act Schedule VI s 2(2) (src:3555-3561)
GIVEN place IS A `ei6 Place for Schedule VI`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Schedule VI s 2(2) the place is in the region of Central Quebec` IF
        place's `ei6 province or territory of the place` EQUALS `ei6 Quebec`
    AND (   (elem cd (LIST 21, 22) AND NOT (area EQUALS `ei6 the Census Metropolitan Area of Quebec City`))
         OR (elem cd (LIST 37, 38) AND NOT (area EQUALS `ei6 the Census Metropolitan Area of Trois-Rivières`))
         OR (elem cd (LIST 41, 42, 44, 45) AND NOT (area EQUALS `ei6 the Census Metropolitan Area of Sherbrooke`))
         OR (elem cd (LIST 52, 60, 75, 76) AND NOT (area EQUALS `ei6 the Census Metropolitan Area of Montréal`))
         OR (cd EQUALS 82 AND NOT (area EQUALS `ei6 the Census Metropolitan Area of Ottawa — Hull`))
         OR `ei6 the number lies from` cd `to` 31 `and` 36
         OR elem cd (LIST 39, 40, 48, 49, 50, 51, 53, 61, 62, 63, 77, 78, 80, 90))
    WHERE
        cd MEANS place's `ei6 census division number of the place`
        area MEANS place's `ei6 area that the place is part of`

-- src:3562 | (3) The region of North Western Quebec, consisting of Census Division Nos. 79, 83 to 89 and 99.
@ref Employment Insurance Act Schedule VI s 2(3) (src:3562)
GIVEN place IS A `ei6 Place for Schedule VI`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Schedule VI s 2(3) the place is in the region of North Western Quebec` IF
        place's `ei6 province or territory of the place` EQUALS `ei6 Quebec`
    AND (   cd EQUALS 79
         OR `ei6 the number lies from` cd `to` 83 `and` 89
         OR cd EQUALS 99)
    WHERE
        cd MEANS place's `ei6 census division number of the place`

-- src:3563 | (4) The region of Lower Saint Lawrence and North Shore, consisting of
-- src:3564 | (a) the portion of Census Division No. 94 that is not part of the Census Metropolitan Area of Chicoutimi — Jonquière; and
-- src:3565 | (b) Census Division Nos. 9 to 18, 28, 91, 92, 93, 95, 96 and 97.
@ref Employment Insurance Act Schedule VI s 2(4) (src:3563-3565)
GIVEN place IS A `ei6 Place for Schedule VI`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Schedule VI s 2(4) the place is in the region of Lower Saint Lawrence and North Shore` IF
        place's `ei6 province or territory of the place` EQUALS `ei6 Quebec`
    AND (   (cd EQUALS 94 AND NOT (area EQUALS `ei6 the Census Metropolitan Area of Chicoutimi — Jonquière`))
         OR `ei6 the number lies from` cd `to` 9 `and` 18
         OR elem cd (LIST 28, 91, 92, 93, 95, 96, 97))
    WHERE
        cd MEANS place's `ei6 census division number of the place`
        area MEANS place's `ei6 area that the place is part of`

-- src:3566 | (5) The region of Chicoutimi — Jonquière, consisting of the Census Metropolitan Area of Chicoutimi — Jonquière.
@ref Employment Insurance Act Schedule VI s 2(5) (src:3566)
GIVEN place IS A `ei6 Place for Schedule VI`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Schedule VI s 2(5) the place is in the region of Chicoutimi — Jonquière` IF
        place's `ei6 province or territory of the place` EQUALS `ei6 Quebec`
    AND place's `ei6 area that the place is part of` EQUALS `ei6 the Census Metropolitan Area of Chicoutimi — Jonquière`

§ `Schedule VI, section 3 - Nova Scotia`

-- src:3569 | 3 (1) The region of Eastern Nova Scotia, consisting of
-- src:3570 | (a) Census Division Nos. 13 to 18; and
-- src:3571 | (b) the portion of Census Division No. 9 that is not part of the Census Metropolitan Area of Halifax.
@ref Employment Insurance Act Schedule VI s 3(1) (src:3569-3571)
GIVEN place IS A `ei6 Place for Schedule VI`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Schedule VI s 3(1) the place is in the region of Eastern Nova Scotia` IF
        place's `ei6 province or territory of the place` EQUALS `ei6 Nova Scotia`
    AND (   `ei6 the number lies from` cd `to` 13 `and` 18
         OR (cd EQUALS 9 AND NOT (area EQUALS `ei6 the Census Metropolitan Area of Halifax`)))
    WHERE
        cd MEANS place's `ei6 census division number of the place`
        area MEANS place's `ei6 area that the place is part of`

-- src:3572 | (2) The region of Western Nova Scotia, consisting of Census Division Nos. 1 to 8, 10, 11 and 12.
@ref Employment Insurance Act Schedule VI s 3(2) (src:3572)
GIVEN place IS A `ei6 Place for Schedule VI`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Schedule VI s 3(2) the place is in the region of Western Nova Scotia` IF
        place's `ei6 province or territory of the place` EQUALS `ei6 Nova Scotia`
    AND (   `ei6 the number lies from` cd `to` 1 `and` 8
         OR elem cd (LIST 10, 11, 12))
    WHERE
        cd MEANS place's `ei6 census division number of the place`

§ `Schedule VI, section 4 - New Brunswick`

-- src:3575 | 4 (1) The region of Madawaska — Charlotte, consisting of
-- src:3576 | (a) the portion of Census Division No. 2 that is not part of the Census Metropolitan Area of Saint John;
-- src:3577 | (b) Census Division Nos. 11, 12 and 13; and
-- src:3578 | (c) Census Subdivision Nos. 1310004, 1310005, 1310006, 1310007, 1310008, 1310011, 1310012, 1310013, 1310014, 1310016, 1310021, 1310024, 1310025 and 1310054.
@ref Employment Insurance Act Schedule VI s 4(1) (src:3575-3578)
GIVEN place IS A `ei6 Place for Schedule VI`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Schedule VI s 4(1) the place is in the region of Madawaska — Charlotte` IF
        place's `ei6 province or territory of the place` EQUALS `ei6 New Brunswick`
    AND (   (cd EQUALS 2 AND NOT (area EQUALS `ei6 the Census Metropolitan Area of Saint John`))
         OR elem cd (LIST 11, 12, 13)
         OR elem csd (LIST 1310004, 1310005, 1310006, 1310007, 1310008, 1310011, 1310012, 1310013, 1310014, 1310016, 1310021, 1310024, 1310025, 1310054))
    WHERE
        cd MEANS place's `ei6 census division number of the place`
        csd MEANS place's `ei6 census subdivision number of the place`
        area MEANS place's `ei6 area that the place is part of`

-- src:3579 | (2) The region of Restigouche — Albert, consisting of
-- src:3580 | (a) Census Division Nos. 8, 9, 14 and 15;
-- src:3581 | (b) Census Subdivision Nos. 1303014 and 1303018;
-- src:3582 | (c) the portion of Census Division No. 4 that is not part of the Census Metropolitan Area of Saint John;
-- src:3583 | (d) the portion of Census Division No. 6 that is not part of the Census Agglomeration of Moncton;
-- src:3584 | (e) Census Subdivision Nos. 1307001, 1307002, 1307004, 1307005, 1307007, 1307008, 1307009, 1307011, 1307012, 1307013, 1307014, 1307016, 1307024, 1307029 and 1307052; and
-- src:3585 | (f) Census Subdivision Nos. 1310036 and 1310037.
@ref Employment Insurance Act Schedule VI s 4(2) (src:3579-3585)
GIVEN place IS A `ei6 Place for Schedule VI`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Schedule VI s 4(2) the place is in the region of Restigouche — Albert` IF
        place's `ei6 province or territory of the place` EQUALS `ei6 New Brunswick`
    AND (   elem cd (LIST 8, 9, 14, 15)
         OR elem csd (LIST 1303014, 1303018)
         OR (cd EQUALS 4 AND NOT (area EQUALS `ei6 the Census Metropolitan Area of Saint John`))
         OR (cd EQUALS 6 AND NOT (area EQUALS `ei6 the Census Agglomeration of Moncton`))
         OR elem csd (LIST 1307001, 1307002, 1307004, 1307005, 1307007, 1307008, 1307009, 1307011, 1307012, 1307013, 1307014, 1307016, 1307024, 1307029, 1307052)
         OR elem csd (LIST 1310036, 1310037))
    WHERE
        cd MEANS place's `ei6 census division number of the place`
        csd MEANS place's `ei6 census subdivision number of the place`
        area MEANS place's `ei6 area that the place is part of`

§ `Schedule VI, section 5 - Prince Edward Island`

-- src:3588 | 5 (1) The region of Charlottetown, consisting of the Census Agglomeration of Charlottetown.
@ref Employment Insurance Act Schedule VI s 5(1) (src:3588)
GIVEN place IS A `ei6 Place for Schedule VI`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Schedule VI s 5(1) the place is in the region of Charlottetown` IF
        place's `ei6 province or territory of the place` EQUALS `ei6 Prince Edward Island`
    AND place's `ei6 area that the place is part of` EQUALS `ei6 the Census Agglomeration of Charlottetown`

-- src:3589 | (2) The region of Prince Edward Island, consisting of all Census Subdivisions that are not part of the Census Agglomeration of Charlottetown.
@ref Employment Insurance Act Schedule VI s 5(2) (src:3589)
GIVEN place IS A `ei6 Place for Schedule VI`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Schedule VI s 5(2) the place is in the region of Prince Edward Island` IF
        place's `ei6 province or territory of the place` EQUALS `ei6 Prince Edward Island`
    AND NOT (place's `ei6 area that the place is part of` EQUALS `ei6 the Census Agglomeration of Charlottetown`)

§ `Schedule VI, sections 6 and 7 - Newfoundland/Labrador and Yukon`

-- src:3592 | 6 The region of Newfoundland/Labrador, consisting of
-- src:3593 | (a) Census Subdivision Nos. 01557 and 01559 and the portion of Census Division No. 1 that is not part of the Census Metropolitan Area of St. John’s; and
-- src:3594 | (b) Census Division Nos. 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8, 9 and 10.
@ref Employment Insurance Act Schedule VI s 6 (src:3592-3594)
GIVEN place IS A `ei6 Place for Schedule VI`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Schedule VI s 6 the place is in the region of Newfoundland/Labrador` IF
        place's `ei6 province or territory of the place` EQUALS `ei6 Newfoundland/Labrador`
    AND (   elem csd (LIST 1557, 1559)
         OR (cd EQUALS 1 AND NOT (area EQUALS `ei6 the Census Metropolitan Area of St. John’s`))
         OR `ei6 the number lies from` cd `to` 2 `and` 10)
    WHERE
        cd MEANS place's `ei6 census division number of the place`
        csd MEANS place's `ei6 census subdivision number of the place`
        area MEANS place's `ei6 area that the place is part of`

-- src:3597 | 7 The region of Yukon, consisting of all Census Subdivisions that are not part of the Census Agglomeration of Whitehorse.
@ref Employment Insurance Act Schedule VI s 7 (src:3597)
GIVEN place IS A `ei6 Place for Schedule VI`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Schedule VI s 7 the place is in the region of Yukon` IF
        place's `ei6 province or territory of the place` EQUALS `ei6 Yukon`
    AND NOT (place's `ei6 area that the place is part of` EQUALS `ei6 the Census Agglomeration of Whitehorse`)

§ `Schedule VI - the region a place is in`

-- src:3554 | 2 (1) The region of Gaspésie — Îles-de-la-Madeleine, consisting of Census Division Nos. 1 to 8 and 98.
-- src:3555 | (2) The region of Central Quebec, consisting of
-- src:3556 | (a) those portions of Census Division Nos. 21 and 22 that are not part of the Census Metropolitan Area of Quebec City;
-- src:3557 | (b) those portions of Census Division Nos. 37 and 38 that are not part of the Census Metropolitan Area of Trois-Rivières;
-- src:3558 | (c) those portions of Census Division Nos. 41, 42, 44 and 45 that are not part of the Census Metropolitan Area of Sherbrooke;
-- src:3559 | (d) those portions of Census Division Nos. 52, 60, 75 and 76 that are not part of the Census Metropolitan Area of Montréal;
-- src:3560 | (e) the portion of Census Division No. 82 that is not part of the Census Metropolitan Area of Ottawa — Hull; and
-- src:3561 | (f) Census Division Nos. 31 to 36, 39, 40, 48, 49, 50, 51, 53, 61, 62, 63, 77, 78, 80 and 90.
-- src:3562 | (3) The region of North Western Quebec, consisting of Census Division Nos. 79, 83 to 89 and 99.
-- src:3563 | (4) The region of Lower Saint Lawrence and North Shore, consisting of
-- src:3564 | (a) the portion of Census Division No. 94 that is not part of the Census Metropolitan Area of Chicoutimi — Jonquière; and
-- src:3565 | (b) Census Division Nos. 9 to 18, 28, 91, 92, 93, 95, 96 and 97.
-- src:3566 | (5) The region of Chicoutimi — Jonquière, consisting of the Census Metropolitan Area of Chicoutimi — Jonquière.
-- src:3568 | Nova Scotia
-- src:3569 | 3 (1) The region of Eastern Nova Scotia, consisting of
-- src:3570 | (a) Census Division Nos. 13 to 18; and
-- src:3571 | (b) the portion of Census Division No. 9 that is not part of the Census Metropolitan Area of Halifax.
-- src:3572 | (2) The region of Western Nova Scotia, consisting of Census Division Nos. 1 to 8, 10, 11 and 12.
-- src:3574 | New Brunswick
-- src:3575 | 4 (1) The region of Madawaska — Charlotte, consisting of
-- src:3576 | (a) the portion of Census Division No. 2 that is not part of the Census Metropolitan Area of Saint John;
-- src:3577 | (b) Census Division Nos. 11, 12 and 13; and
-- src:3578 | (c) Census Subdivision Nos. 1310004, 1310005, 1310006, 1310007, 1310008, 1310011, 1310012, 1310013, 1310014, 1310016, 1310021, 1310024, 1310025 and 1310054.
-- src:3579 | (2) The region of Restigouche — Albert, consisting of
-- src:3580 | (a) Census Division Nos. 8, 9, 14 and 15;
-- src:3581 | (b) Census Subdivision Nos. 1303014 and 1303018;
-- src:3582 | (c) the portion of Census Division No. 4 that is not part of the Census Metropolitan Area of Saint John;
-- src:3583 | (d) the portion of Census Division No. 6 that is not part of the Census Agglomeration of Moncton;
-- src:3584 | (e) Census Subdivision Nos. 1307001, 1307002, 1307004, 1307005, 1307007, 1307008, 1307009, 1307011, 1307012, 1307013, 1307014, 1307016, 1307024, 1307029 and 1307052; and
-- src:3585 | (f) Census Subdivision Nos. 1310036 and 1310037.
-- src:3587 | Prince Edward Island
-- src:3588 | 5 (1) The region of Charlottetown, consisting of the Census Agglomeration of Charlottetown.
-- src:3589 | (2) The region of Prince Edward Island, consisting of all Census Subdivisions that are not part of the Census Agglomeration of Charlottetown.
-- src:3591 | Newfoundland/Labrador
-- src:3592 | 6 The region of Newfoundland/Labrador, consisting of
-- src:3593 | (a) Census Subdivision Nos. 01557 and 01559 and the portion of Census Division No. 1 that is not part of the Census Metropolitan Area of St. John’s; and
-- src:3594 | (b) Census Division Nos. 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8, 9 and 10.
-- src:3596 | Yukon
-- src:3597 | 7 The region of Yukon, consisting of all Census Subdivisions that are not part of the Census Agglomeration of Whitehorse.
@ref Employment Insurance Act Schedule VI ss 2 to 7 (src:3554-3597)
GIVEN place IS A `ei6 Place for Schedule VI`
GIVETH A `ei6 Region of Schedule VI`
DECIDE `Schedule VI the region the place is in` IS
    BRANCH IF `Schedule VI s 2(1) the place is in the region of Gaspésie — Îles-de-la-Madeleine` place THEN `ei6 the region of Gaspésie — Îles-de-la-Madeleine`
           IF `Schedule VI s 2(2) the place is in the region of Central Quebec` place THEN `ei6 the region of Central Quebec`
           IF `Schedule VI s 2(3) the place is in the region of North Western Quebec` place THEN `ei6 the region of North Western Quebec`
           IF `Schedule VI s 2(4) the place is in the region of Lower Saint Lawrence and North Shore` place THEN `ei6 the region of Lower Saint Lawrence and North Shore`
           IF `Schedule VI s 2(5) the place is in the region of Chicoutimi — Jonquière` place THEN `ei6 the region of Chicoutimi — Jonquière`
           IF `Schedule VI s 3(1) the place is in the region of Eastern Nova Scotia` place THEN `ei6 the region of Eastern Nova Scotia`
           IF `Schedule VI s 3(2) the place is in the region of Western Nova Scotia` place THEN `ei6 the region of Western Nova Scotia`
           IF `Schedule VI s 4(1) the place is in the region of Madawaska — Charlotte` place THEN `ei6 the region of Madawaska — Charlotte`
           IF `Schedule VI s 4(2) the place is in the region of Restigouche — Albert` place THEN `ei6 the region of Restigouche — Albert`
           IF `Schedule VI s 5(1) the place is in the region of Charlottetown` place THEN `ei6 the region of Charlottetown`
           IF `Schedule VI s 5(2) the place is in the region of Prince Edward Island` place THEN `ei6 the region of Prince Edward Island`
           IF `Schedule VI s 6 the place is in the region of Newfoundland/Labrador` place THEN `ei6 the region of Newfoundland/Labrador`
           IF `Schedule VI s 7 the place is in the region of Yukon` place THEN `ei6 the region of Yukon`
           OTHERWISE `ei6 no region of Schedule VI`
